---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import { GOVERN_PARTNER_URL } from "../../data/docs";
---

<DocsLayout title="Echophi — Partner Integration Guide">
  <h1>Partner Integration Guide</h1>
  <p>Recommended path from an empty tenant to live call lifecycle notifications.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Generate an API key in{" "}
      <a href={GOVERN_PARTNER_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        Govern → Partner API
      </a>
      .
    </li>
    <li>
      Configure a webhook endpoint (recommended) — Govern or{" "}
      <a href={`/playground?op=${encodeURIComponent("post:/webhook-endpoints")}`}>Playground</a>{" "}
      <code>POST /webhook-endpoints</code>.
    </li>
    <li>
      Verify it using a test event (<code>POST /webhook-endpoints/{"{id}"}/test</code> or Govern{" "}
      <strong>Test</strong>).
    </li>
    <li>
      Start conversations using <code>POST /api/external/v1/conversations</code>.
    </li>
    <li>Receive lifecycle notifications on your webhook.</li>
    <li>
      Optionally subscribe to <code>partner.events.{"{customer_id}"}</code> if using NATS.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Full step-by-step with Playground ops:{" "}
    <a href="/docs/receive-webhooks">End-to-end Webhook Walkthrough</a>. HMAC details:{" "}
    <a href="/docs/verify-hmac">Verify HMAC</a>.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
